BHWIDE: 
    A Monte Carlo Event Generator for Bhabha Scattering
    at Large (Wide) Angles with O(alpha) EW YFS Exponentiation. 

Writtten by: 
   S. Jadach, W. Placzek and B.F.L. Ward

--------------
Documentation:
--------------

There is still no COMPLETE UP-TO-DATE documentation, sorry!
See comments in the source code, for example in: 
   bhwide-1.07-export/bhw/bhwide.f, bhwid1.f, model1.f, model2.f

